        "id": "YonePassive",
        "name": "Way of the Hunter",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "Yone deals magic damage with every second Attack. In addition, his critical strike chance is increased.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Steel and Spirit:</span> Yone uses two blades, causing every second Attack to deal <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">50% magic damage</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Intent:</span> Yone's Critical Strike Chance is increased by 100% but his Critical Strike Damage is reduced to (100% Critical Strike Damage). Gain <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\"> Bonus AD</span> for every 1% Critical Strike Chance above 100%.",
