      "Q": {
        "slot": "Q",
        "id": "YoneQ",
        "name": "Mortal Steel",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Thrusts forward, damaging all enemies in a line.<br><br>On hit, grants a stack of Gathering Storm for a few seconds. At 2 stacks, Mortal Steel dashes Yone forward with a gust of wind knocking enemies <status>Airborne</status>.",
        "bodyHtml": "Yone thrusts forward, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(25/50/75/100/125 + (110% Attack Damage)) physical damage</span>.<br /><br />On hit, grants a stack for 6 seconds. At 2 stacks, this ability causes Yone to dash forward with a wave of wind that <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knocks Up</span> for 0.75 seconds and deals <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(25/50/75/100/125 + (110% Attack Damage)) physical damage</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">This Ability acts like an Attack: it can critically strike for <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(25/50/75/100/125 + (0% Attack Damage)) physical damage</span>, it applies <span>On-hit</span> effects and lifesteal to the first enemy struck, is interruptible by crowd control, and its cooldown and cast time are reduced with <span>Attack Speed</span>.</span>",
