        "name": "Soul Unbound",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Yone's spirit leaves his body behind, gaining Move Speed. When this ability ends, Yone's spirit is forced back to his body and he repeats a portion of the damage he dealt as a spirit.",
        "bodyHtml": "Yone enters a spirit form for 5 seconds, leaving his body behind for the duration and gaining <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">10%</span> to <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">30% ramping Move Speed</span>. <br /><br />When the spirit form ends, Yone snaps back to his body and repeats 25/27.5/30/32.5/35% of all Attack and Ability damage he dealt to champions during this time. You may <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast</span> this ability during spirit form.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast: </span>End spirit form early.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Yone cannot snap back while affected by hard crowd control.</span>",
